    given-names: Eldad
repository-code: "https://github.com/etsabary/visual-decision-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/etsabary/visual-decision-benchmark"
version: "2026-10-15-c1"
date-released: 2026-10-15
abstract: "A dated comparison of Jev 1.14 Decisions, GPT-6 Luna Decisions, regular GPT-6 Luna, GPT-5.4 nano and Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite on the same 200 multiple-choice visual decisions. Results include accuracy, coverage, latency, returned cost, ability profiles and exploratory confidence thresholds. The public release includes 221 of 227 tested image files; six charts are referenced pending third-party terms review. The gold key remains external."
